    "is_free": true,
    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3529390/extras/cc2dd703f579b6c4d05d318e1da5f792.poster.avif?t=1751479282\" width=800 height=166 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3529390/extras/cc2dd703f579b6c4d05d318e1da5f792.webm?t=1751479282\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3529390/extras/cc2dd703f579b6c4d05d318e1da5f792.mp4?t=1751479282\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Get Hooked on this Fishing Adventure\u2026\u00a0Where The Fish Fight Back!</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Step into the boots of a legendary fisherman returning from a shameful retirement. Travel the coastline chasing after exotic fish and regaining your forgotten skills. But beware \u2013 deadly catches are lurking everywhere\u2026</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong> </strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Take down a variety of comical bosses in fast-paced, high-intensity fights! Cast your fishing line like a grappling hook to sling yourself around stages, while also using your rod to smack sea monsters into submission!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3529390/extras/fedfe7a1d2d57eb28ced77a9d0d61c23.poster.avif?t=1751479282\" width=800 height=240 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3529390/extras/fedfe7a1d2d57eb28ced77a9d0d61c23.webm?t=1751479282\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3529390/extras/fedfe7a1d2d57eb28ced77a9d0d61c23.mp4?t=1751479282\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>The One That Got Away\u2026</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Twenty years ago, <i>The Big One</i> got away and forced you into an early retirement. But now, you finally have the chance to redeem your reputation following recent sightings of the mythical monster! Follow the trail of rumors while taking down other terrible creatures that have been terrorizing the coast, including <i>Mini Minnow</i>, <i>Big Bass</i>, <i>Crude Crab</i>, and <i>Swordmaster Swordfish</i>.\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3529390/extras/45eb8cdd2b5da50ebf7d659bd433af26.poster.avif?t=1751479282\" width=800 height=240 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3529390/extras/45eb8cdd2b5da50ebf7d659bd433af26.webm?t=1751479282\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3529390/extras/45eb8cdd2b5da50ebf7d659bd433af26.mp4?t=1751479282\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>No Laughing Matter.</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Don\u2019t let their wacky appearance fool you: each boss fight will push you to your limits and provide fresh challenges that force you to make the most of the fishing rod you wield. You\u2019ll learn to master various movement techniques and boss patterns while constantly switching up strategies and adapting on the fly! As you improve, chase high scores as you replay past fights and challenge yourself with Super-Boss versions of fights! A suite of accessibility options ensures that you can play by your own rules and rise to any challenge.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3529390/extras/49d8e25ea5966e3471716e49d5bfe529.poster.avif?t=1751479282\" width=800 height=240 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3529390/extras/49d8e25ea5966e3471716e49d5bfe529.webm?t=1751479282\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3529390/extras/49d8e25ea5966e3471716e49d5bfe529.mp4?t=1751479282\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Gotta Fish \u2018Em All!</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Chase after dozens and dozens of unique fish (and secret easter eggs) in each location! With unique rarities, difficulties, and <i>Fast-Fish-Facts</i>, filling up your Fishdex is no easy task\u2026\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3529390/extras/4665a8d10ea13d1e41b0188e8b31abd5.poster.avif?t=1751479282\" width=800 height=240 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3529390/extras/4665a8d10ea13d1e41b0188e8b31abd5.webm?t=1751479282\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3529390/extras/4665a8d10ea13d1e41b0188e8b31abd5.mp4?t=1751479282\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Download for Free Today!</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Filled with hand-crafted pixel art, gut-busting jokes, and nail-biting challenges, the world of <i>Bait &amp; Tackle</i> awaits\u2026 Grab your fishing rod, cast your line, and chase after <i>The One that Got Away</i>!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3529390/extras/453102cc53d1057796c6d0a3882fa731.poster.avif?t=1751479282\" width=800 height=334 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3529390/extras/453102cc53d1057796c6d0a3882fa731.webm?t=1751479282\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3529390/extras/453102cc53d1057796c6d0a3882fa731.mp4?t=1751479282\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3529390/extras/cc2dd703f579b6c4d05d318e1da5f792.poster.avif?t=1751479282\" width=800 height=166 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3529390/extras/cc2dd703f579b6c4d05d318e1da5f792.webm?t=1751479282\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3529390/extras/cc2dd703f579b6c4d05d318e1da5f792.mp4?t=1751479282\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Get Hooked on this Fishing Adventure\u2026\u00a0Where The Fish Fight Back!</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Step into the boots of a legendary fisherman returning from a shameful retirement. Travel the coastline chasing after exotic fish and regaining your forgotten skills. But beware \u2013 deadly catches are lurking everywhere\u2026</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong> </strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Take down a variety of comical bosses in fast-paced, high-intensity fights! Cast your fishing line like a grappling hook to sling yourself around stages, while also using your rod to smack sea monsters into submission!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3529390/extras/fedfe7a1d2d57eb28ced77a9d0d61c23.poster.avif?t=1751479282\" width=800 height=240 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3529390/extras/fedfe7a1d2d57eb28ced77a9d0d61c23.webm?t=1751479282\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3529390/extras/fedfe7a1d2d57eb28ced77a9d0d61c23.mp4?t=1751479282\" type=\"video/